{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 22, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived in Tokyo, I was struck by the city's vibrant energy and rich culture. I spent my days exploring the city's many temples and shrines, including the famous Meiji Shrine, where I marveled at the beautiful gardens and tranquil atmosphere.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the Tsukiji Outer Market, where I sampled some of the freshest sushi I've ever had. The fish was incredibly fresh and delicious, and the bustling atmosphere of the market was a thrill to experience.\n\nI also had the opportunity to visit the city of Kyoto, where I was amazed by the stunning beauty of the Kinkaku-ji Temple, also known as the Golden Pavilion. The temple's gleaming golden exterior was even more breathtaking in person, and the surrounding gardens were serene and peaceful.\n\nThroughout my trip, I was struck by the kindness and hospitality of the Japanese people. Everywhere I went, I was greeted with a smile and a bow, and I felt welcomed and at ease. Japan is a country that seamlessly blends tradition and modernity, and I left with a deep appreciation for its unique culture and way of life. Overall, my trip to Japan was an incredible adventure that I'll always treasure.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.42304468154907227}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.0032410495914518833}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.271740287251305e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.25508132576942444}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5826178193092346}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0004444326623342931}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.00020358874462544918}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.00013124081306159496},